      "diff": "@@ -268,21 +268,21 @@ openSUSE 15.3 RPM Test:\n     - tshark --version\n   needs: [ 'openSUSE 15.3 RPM Package' ]\n \n-Rocky Linux 8 RPM Package:\n+Rocky Linux 9 RPM Package:\n   extends: .build-rpm\n-  image: registry.gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark-containers/rockylinux-8-dev\n+  image: registry.gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark-containers/rockylinux-9-dev\n   script:\n     - printf \"\\e[0Ksection_start:%s:cmake_section[collapsed=true]\\r\\e[0KRunning CMake\" \"$( date +%s)\"\n     - cmake -GNinja ..\n     - printf \"\\e[0Ksection_end:%s:cmake_section\\r\\e[0K\" \"$( date +%s)\"\n     - ninja-build wireshark_rpm\n-Rocky Linux 8 RPM Test:\n+Rocky Linux 9 RPM Test:\n   extends: .test-rpm\n-  image: registry.gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark-containers/rockylinux-8-dev\n+  image: registry.gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark-containers/rockylinux-9-dev\n   script:\n     - dnf --nogpgcheck localinstall -y build/packaging/rpm/RPMS/x86_64/*.rpm\n     - tshark --version\n-  needs: [ 'Rocky Linux 8 RPM Package' ]\n+  needs: [ 'Rocky Linux 9 RPM Package' ]\n \n Ubuntu APT Package:\n   extends: .build-ubuntu\n",
